Jabberwocks are excellent pets, and it's MUCH easier to get them than
to get a wand of polymorph.  Simply get magic resistance (via Magicbane,
cloak of magic resistance, gray dragon scale mail, or some artifact),
find polymorph trap.  Step on trap.  Wait for pet to be adjacent or
use magic whistle to get him there.  Displace your pet onto the trap.
The only dead-end polymorph of pets I've seen is long worms because of
their size, but otherwise, even blue jellies and balrogs can be poly-
morphed with a few tries.

